      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am wondering if we should name this differently because the C++ ScopedMinijail  just calls minijail_destroy like our struct Minijail. I am fine with leaving the name as is, but I wanted to raise the point in case you had a good idea for a name that would help distinguish the different use cases.",
